# 🐧 Linux Commands Notes (English + Hinglish)

## 📁 Linux File System

Linux me sab kuch root directory se start hota hai:

/
Ye `/` root folder hota hai.

Common folders:

| Folder | Meaning (English) | Hinglish |
|--------|--------------------|----------|
| /home  | User home folders  | Users ke personal folders |
| /bin   | Important commands | System commands yaha hote hain |
| /etc   | Config files       | System settings files |
| /var   | Logs & cache       | Dynamic data, logs |

